WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:21.200 --> 00:00:22.200
He went that way.

00:00:22.540 --> 00:00:24.080
North-West 100 meters.

00:00:24.580 --> 00:00:25.320
No weapon.

00:00:25.780 --> 00:00:26.560
Easy kill.

00:00:28.100 --> 00:00:28.680
Car!

00:00:28.840 --> 00:00:30.160
No, plane.

00:00:31.740 --> 00:00:32.740
Watch for the drop.

00:00:33.380 --> 00:00:34.980
I could use a bigger gun.

00:01:22.340 --> 00:01:24.160
Oh shit. That's real close.

00:01:24.600 --> 00:01:25.600
Let's get it.

00:01:26.180 --> 00:01:27.240
That's a death trap.

00:01:27.640 --> 00:01:30.040
We haven't seen anyone out here for hours.

00:01:30.640 --> 00:01:32.000
We're probably the only ones left.

00:01:32.180 --> 00:01:33.420
I mean the game's still going, right?

00:01:33.900 --> 00:01:34.880
Then there's other people left.

00:01:34.920 --> 00:01:36.600
Yeah, cause they're watching the crate!

00:01:36.840 --> 00:01:38.500
Look, I don't even have a gun.

00:01:38.620 --> 00:01:40.200
You have a freaking frying pan!

00:01:40.360 --> 00:01:41.940
If we don't get what's in that crate

00:01:41.940 --> 00:01:43.860
we're getting killed by the guys who do.

00:01:59.440 --> 00:02:00.900
What do you think we get if we win?

00:02:01.320 --> 00:02:03.080
Probably a million dollars, or something.

00:02:03.360 --> 00:02:04.180
Be great.

00:02:04.200 --> 00:02:06.260
You know what would be great? Not dying.

00:02:06.260 --> 00:02:08.840
How about not dying, and a million bucks?

00:02:10.060 --> 00:02:12.240
You cross that field, you're going to get shot!

00:02:12.480 --> 00:02:14.040
Look, just crawl. No one will see you.

00:02:18.760 --> 00:02:20.080
I can see you guys.

00:02:20.080 --> 00:02:21.080
If somebody shoots at us

00:02:21.600 --> 00:02:22.700
shoot at them.

00:02:24.440 --> 00:02:26.440
Eh, I can do that. Alright.

00:02:52.080 --> 00:02:53.080
How do you open it?

00:03:30.420 --> 00:03:31.760
Surprise mother fucker!

00:03:40.000 --> 00:03:41.560
You forgot to rack it, didn't you?

00:03:58.180 --> 00:03:59.180
Guys.

00:04:03.380 --> 00:04:04.180
Grena-

00:05:01.480 --> 00:05:02.660
I got this, from this pack.

00:05:02.660 --> 00:05:03.960
It should help take the edge off.

00:05:10.000 --> 00:05:11.080
Is it over?

00:05:11.300 --> 00:05:13.080
Niko killed a guy with a frying pan.

00:05:13.280 --> 00:05:13.900
No shit.

00:05:35.580 --> 00:05:36.800
Wha-What?

00:05:47.220 --> 00:05:49.340
You guys forgot the main weapon?

00:05:49.340 --> 00:05:50.540
Wren. Chill, chill, chill.

00:05:50.540 --> 00:05:51.700
Sam's not happy about it.

00:05:51.700 --> 00:05:53.460
So I don't know where that f**king scope is.

00:05:54.220 --> 00:05:56.520
They forgot a radio so I have no idea what's going on over there right now.

00:05:56.620 --> 00:05:59.080
The lady, she's gone by probably twelve times now.

